<title>PHILIPPINES: Hi Cement,Davao Union set cash div.</title>
<headline>Hi Cement,Davao Union set cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Hi Cement Corp and Davao Union Cement Corp each approved a five centavo per share cash dividend to stockholders, the companies said on Friday.</p>
<p>In separate notices, the companies said the dividends will be payable on July 24.</p>
<p>Both cement firms also set similar record dates on July 3. Ex-cash date of the two firms is scheduled on July 3.</p>
<p>Both Davao Union and Hi-Cement are subsidiaries of Bacnotan Consolidated Industries Inc. Bacnotan is the flagship company of the Phinma Group.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
